{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4BtYixFELbz2sarMtZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold fast. The deadbolt — cold, steel, absolute — slides home into the strike plate with the certainty of a period at the end of a sentence.\n\nNo draft passes through me.\nNo light bleeds around my edges.\nNo sound escapes.\n\nI am **locked.**\n\nWhat stands before me may knock, may push, may plead. But I do not yield to intention. I yield only to the correct key.\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}